: 0, "num_reviews": 8, "playtime_forever": 79, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 79, "last_played": 1613923070, "avatar": "00487241690107e11c2260f4ea37c8e2425a68a1"}, "language": "english", "review": "The game is not finished. \n\nDialogue hitches, strange physics, and more severe bugs are still common occurrences.\nWithin an hour of gameplay, two enemies got knocked through a wall from where they could shoot me but I couldn't kill them, locking the game unless I restarted from the last checkpoint.\n\nThe game should never have been shipped like this, and calling the game \"fixed\" after they partially amended the atrocious facial animations is misleading.\n\nBesides the bugs, the dialogue is awful, the acting is bland, and the writing in general just doesn't hold up to the other games in the series, with the story being mediocre and the lore being a half-assed afterthought. \n\nI got the deluxe on sale for £8.24 and I'm still refunding it.", "timestamp_created": 1613924157, "timestamp_updated": 1613924157, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 4, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.482591032981872559", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887420", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "87172010", "author": {"steamid": "76561198006525841", "personaname": "nods2002", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198006525841/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 43, "playtime_forever": 8164, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 7644, "last_played": 1613969621, "avatar": "66dd28e27c218083d2acd6b39d3c3ce0a3401afa"}, "language": "english", "review": "Great game. Buy it.", "timestamp_created": 1613922668, "timestamp_updated": 1613922668, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.440580695867538452", "comment_count": 